      "summary_en": "Morgana unleashes the full force of her Celestial power as she unbinds her wings and hovers above the ground. She lashes chains of dark pain onto nearby enemy champions, gaining Move Speed. The chains slow and deal initial damage and, after a delay, stun those who are unable to break them.",
      "summary_zh": "莫甘娜全力释放她的星界能量，与此同时，她的羽翼会解除束缚并且会悬浮在地面上。她将黑暗痛苦组成的锁链抽击到附近的敌方英雄身上，获得移动速度。锁链会减速并造成初段伤害，并在一段延迟后，晕眩那些未能挣脱的敌方英雄。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1308058:4020315"
